# qwen3-8b: estimation-set size, 96 vs 288 pairs, DAS and mean-difference (same 192 tuning pairs, same 337 test pairs)

Old sweeps `/workspace/Truth_Decoupling/results_das_tf/E23/qwen3-8b/knob_sweep_{das_tf_full,meandiff_full}` (1442 items) re-cut to the new split defined by `/workspace/Truth_Decoupling/results_das_tf_r288/E23/qwen3-8b` (1058 items; 192 pairs moved into the estimation set). Rule on the tuning pairs: E = max dJ s.t. |d ans| <= 0.03, tie-break = sweep order (dJ compared as an exact integer count). Test pairs reported with pair-bootstrap 95% CIs (2000 resamples, seed 0); differences are paired on the same resamples.

